OL,3,GNEWSAElectric ambulance charger 'an
OL,4,Aimportant step'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new electric vehicle (EV) rapid
OL,7,Fcharger has been installed at a
OL,8,Fhospital in what has been called "an
OL,9,Fimportant step" for its ambulance
OL,10,Fservice.
OL,12,FNorth East Ambulance Service (NEAS)
OL,13,Fsaid it hoped the new charger at the
OL,14,FUniversity Hospital of North Tees would
OL,15,Fhelp the NHS achieve its long-term goal
OL,16,Fof reaching net zero carbon emissions.
OL,18,FThe new dual rapid charger allows
OL,19,Fvehicles to charge quickly while
OL,20,Foperating in Teesside and joins a
OL,21,Fgrowing network of chargers at NHS
OL,22,Fsites across the North East.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
