OL,3,GNEWSAElectric ambulance charger 'an
OL,4,Aimportant step'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNEAS operates more than 600 vehicles
OL,7,Ffrom 63 ambulance stations and three
OL,8,Foperations centres across the region.
OL,9,FIn 2025/26, its teams attended 442,168
OL,10,Fincidents and took 298,307 patients to
OL,11,Fhospital.
